WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:03.390
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:03.390
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:09.330
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:09.330
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:19.900
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.840
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.860
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.860
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:27.300
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:27.300
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:31.070
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:31.070
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:35.350
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:35.350
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:38.790
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:38.790
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:45.380
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:45.380
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:49.840
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:49.840
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:49.910
I can say love

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:53.640
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:53.640
It overflows with love.

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:53.640
will you love me?

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:57.250
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:57.250
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.200
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.200
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:03.760
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:03.760
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:08.410
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:08.410
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.470
Let's get back to the GP, Fuku.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:56.010
Our next job's waiting for us.

00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:03.350
Fuku-chan Runs 
Away

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:10.620
Blast 'em! Blast 'em!

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:15.400
Unidentified ships, recognition response red!

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:17.400
Pirates!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:20.600
Perfect! I'll use 'em to test out this ship's tactical systems!

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:29.380
Energy output falling!

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:31.350
Fuku! Get a hold of yourself!

00:02:33.350 --> 00:02:34.920
It's out of control!

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.250
Switching all controls to manual!

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:40.820
302 until energy output reaches critical!

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:44.260
The pirate ships are closing in!

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:47.030
Transfer shield energy to the tactical systems!

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:50.030
This is your first time... can you handle it without any system support?

00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:52.730
If we don't hold anything back, then yeah!

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:00.000
Man...

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:03.350
Luckily we managed to take them down, but still...

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:06.880
There's nothing we can do. Fuku-chan's still a baby, after all.

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:12.250
But having the Kamidake's abilities rely on her emotions is a little too...

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.780
I agree...

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:25.800
There you go! All clean!

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.800
It's almost time for work.

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:30.010
Let's go, Fuku.

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:31.210
I'm sorry.

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:35.940
If I didn't have this job, I wouldn't have to put you in scary situations...

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:39.410
Well, let's go.

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:47.020
Multiple pirate ships detected!

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:48.390
Output down.

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:51.550
It's all right, Fuku-chan! Don't be afraid!

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:52.990
Try hard!

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:58.460
Blast 'em even more!

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:03.530
S-stupid! If we turn around now...!

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:18.890
Everyone messes up once in a while. Don't worry about it!

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:21.660
OK, Fuku?

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:23.190
Seina-chan.

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:24.060
Yes?

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:27.660
We talked it over and we think it might be best for Fuku-chan

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:30.730
if we built a sub-system...

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:32.200
A sub-system?

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.200
Yes.

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:34.900
We would break it up so that I would take care of the OS,

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:36.870
Amane would handle the tactical systems,

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:40.330
and Ryoko would be in charge of the piloting systems.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:44.050
If things remain like this, not only will our mission be in jeopardy,

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:47.480
but Fuku-chan will also be putting herself in extreme danger.

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.880
I suppose you're right...

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:00.600
Listen, Fuku.

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:04.030
Kiriko-san and the others are doing it for your sake.

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:10.100
Well, good night.

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:18.550
I still have work to do.

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:22.570
I'll play with you when I'm done, so stay here and watch the place, okay?

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:34.160
Fuku-chan. Don't unplug that cord.

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:38.230
Today we're only doing training for data-gathering purposes,

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:40.100
so there won't be any pirates.

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:47.940
Gate 13 cleared!

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:50.810
Energy generator output stable.

00:05:50.810 --> 00:05:53.550
No irregularities detected in the control data.

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:56.480
Now heading for Gates 14 and 15.

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:07.260
Overdrive on! Executing piloting program!

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:11.230
Navigation system activated!

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.400
Gate 14 cleared.

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:18.070
Gate 15 now cleared.

00:06:18.070 --> 00:06:21.100
Okay! We've collected our piloting data.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:24.540
You did great, Fuku!

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:29.050
Next is target practice!

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:34.690
Locking on to all targets!

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:39.990
Fire lasers!

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:46.470
All targets have been hit!

00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:49.740
Reaction time, 0.023!

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:52.410
Tactical system data collection complete!

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:54.030
All done, Fuku-chan!

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:58.680
Good work!

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:04.050
Geez... If only she could do this well during the real thing...

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:15.760
Well, we have all the data we need.

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:19.220
Yeah. Now we should be able to manage even without Fuku.

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:25.710
Now, now. We're all trying to work.

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:28.970
What's the matter? You aren't going to eat?

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.000
Are you feeling sick?

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.360
You sure act like a little kid...

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:50.000
Seina. Could you check line B-125?

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:51.160
Right!

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:07.710
Huh?

00:08:11.890 --> 00:08:13.080
Now, now.

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:18.330
Don't be bringing this in here.

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:20.960
Our prototype sub-system is finished,

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:23.520
so help us out for only 2 or 3 more days, okay?

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:29.130
Soon you won't have to worry about being frightened anymore!

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.540
Pretty soon we won't even need you to be on the ship!

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:35.070
Be a good girl and hold down the fort while we're gone, Fuku!

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:51.390
Output down. Switching controls over to sub-system!

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:54.560
Now in full control of the piloting system!

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:57.230
Laser energy stored and ready!

00:08:57.230 --> 00:09:00.100
Synchronization with tactical systems is confirmed!

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:36.510
What's wrong, Fuku-chan?

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:37.700
What is it?

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:42.540
That's right! Here you are!

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:45.070
The other towel was dirty so here's a new one!

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:38.500
Huh?

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:43.700
What are you doing here, Fuku?

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:58.550
Huh? There's an error in the line...

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:01.190
I wonder if the parts are faulty.

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:03.960
Wait here, it's dangerous.

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:05.720
Be a good girl and wait for me now!

00:11:29.780 --> 00:11:31.680
What's the matter, Ryo-Ohki?

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:39.560
Oh, her? I suppose you could call her your sister.

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:48.400
I can't wait to see what she grows up to be like...

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:27.480
Whoops, I fell asleep...

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:29.710
Oh yeah, there was that error...

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:35.120
It looks like space outside!

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.120
And it looks like we're flying!

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:39.710
W-why are we in space...?!

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:46.090
Huh? It won't open!

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:48.260
How come? What's going on...?

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:50.570
Hey, Fuku! Are you there?!

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:53.370
Fuku! Open up, Fuku!

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:54.370
Come on! Hurry!

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:57.130
Come on, Fuku! Fuku!

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:02.080
We're truly sorry...

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:03.550
My word...

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:06.480
It's not surprising that the Kamidake's whereabouts are unknown.

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:09.480
We were told that the Kamidake passed by a nearby administrative bureau,

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:13.390
but there hasn't been a single report since.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:15.360
Hailing it has also proven useless.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:18.930
Ryo-Ohki types are difficult to detect.

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:22.660
What is that Fuku thinking by running away...?!

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:26.500
You three. I hear you built a sub-system.

00:13:26.500 --> 00:13:30.840
We only did it to reduce the burden of responsibility on Fuku-chan...

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:34.380
We felt it was necessary as Fuku isn't accustomed to combat.

00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:38.380
That is the reason we were given the Kamidake, after all...

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:41.580
You certainly are exceptional.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:45.820
Calmly analyzing Fuku-chan...

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:50.830
Even when Fuku-chan is afraid, crying, lonely, or wants affection,

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:54.690
you continue to view her as a computer.

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:59.400
The reason she's afraid of combat is because she doesn't trust you!

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:03.710
Somewhere in your minds you perceive her as an object.

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:05.710
How can you say that...? We're...!

00:14:05.710 --> 00:14:09.380
You're irritated with a machine that won't do what it's supposed to.

00:14:09.380 --> 00:14:12.980
Having love for something... even if it's a machine... is a good thing.

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:16.920
Pouring your love into something is the same as getting to know it.

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:19.320
What's more, she has a will of her own.

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:21.460
If your wills come together and bond,

00:14:21.460 --> 00:14:24.890
Fuku-chan and the ship will try to get to know you.

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:28.300
That's the power of Ryo-Ohki.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:30.830
That's the power of Juraian ships!

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:34.390
Embrace her more, pet her more, talk to her more.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:40.840
In Washu-sama's eyes, Fuku-chan is like a daughter.

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:46.210
As the ones she entrusted her to, you need to rethink things over carefully.

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:47.550
Yes...

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:49.350
Good.

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:53.480
Now then, where could Fuku-chan have gone, anyway?

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:58.260
Fuku. You're there, aren't you?

00:14:58.260 --> 00:15:00.320
Could you open the door for me soon?

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:03.360
What the...?!

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:07.040
Fuku! Hey! Open up!

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:09.000
Come on! Hurry! Fuku!

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:14.540
Fuku! What in the world's...?!

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:20.180
Pirates...

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:34.890
How did we wind up here?

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:38.400
Good question...

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:40.540
Naoko-san...

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:41.370
Um...

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:46.540
Wow!

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:49.480
Our ship has just entered combat mode.

00:15:49.480 --> 00:15:52.310
Please wait just a little longer for your meal.

00:15:52.310 --> 00:15:54.610
We'd love to!

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:59.020
Airi-sama.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:03.630
She's likely been stricken with homesickness and returned to Washu-sama.

00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:07.600
After all, Fuku-chan still is a baby.

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:10.030
I see! Oh no!

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:13.970
Seina-kun's the only one on the Kamidake besides Fuku-chan, isn't he?!

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:22.000
All I can do is run away too?!

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:26.950
What's the Kamidake's location?!

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:33.080
Just a second.

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:37.030
Amazing...

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:40.460
To think that you can connect to almost all of the academy's network...

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:42.160
Come on!

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:45.530
I found it! I'm picking up a distress signal from the Kamidake...

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:48.200
But it's too far from here...

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:49.540
What about reinforcements?

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:51.140
There are too many enemy ships.

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:54.340
We wouldn't have time to organize such a large-scale rescue fleet...!

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:58.210
I'm pretty sure there's a secret Juraian supply base near there!

00:16:58.210 --> 00:17:00.250
How do you know something like that, Amane?!

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:02.680
Heard about it from good ol' Mihoshi.

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:04.890
We could use the teleport gate in the chairwoman's office to get there...!

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:06.820
Plus we can use you-know-what too!

00:17:06.820 --> 00:17:08.450
It's supposed to be classified...

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:15.760
Hurry, hurry...!

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:21.370
We're over the weight limit?!

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:22.540
Dammit...!

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:24.530
We have no other choice!

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:28.480
Still?!

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:30.070
We can't take any more off...

00:17:32.180 --> 00:17:34.280
What a great view this is!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:36.520
You get outta here!

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:37.580
Ouch!

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:44.850
Here we go!

00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:50.100
Delicious!

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:53.470
Seto-sama. Amane-sama wishes to speak to you.

00:17:53.470 --> 00:17:56.800
I wonder what she could want?

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:59.240
Please lend us the Chobimaru!

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:00.880
You get straight to the point, don't you?

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:05.010
What do you intend to use the Chobimaru for? To start a war?

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:09.980
We went through a lot for the Neige mission, and a lot before that even!

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:14.820
Well, it is true that I'm in your debt, and I realize that you're in a hurry,

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:18.490
but from now on please refrain from asking for favors after the fact.

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:21.060
So, if you would, please...

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:22.060
Who do you think you are?

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:24.800
I even have permission from Seto-sama, don't I?

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:27.370
Forgive her, Mashisu-sama...

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:29.770
Well, if it's Ryo-chan's sister who's in danger,

00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:31.710
then there's no other choice, is there?

00:18:34.010 --> 00:18:36.370
Combat zone located!

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:50.120
It's okay. We'll be just fine.

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:53.020
Seina! You okay?!

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:56.700
Kamidake detected!

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:58.400
It looks like we made it in time!

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:01.390
Amane-san! What in the world is that ship...?!

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:08.500
...How dare they harass Fuku-chan! ...How dare they harass Fuku-chan! ...How dare they harass Fuku-chan!

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:15.970
Wait! The Kamidake's too close!

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:19.880
It's okay, Fuku. You're strong.

00:19:21.190 --> 00:19:26.060
And you're the sister of the legendary ship Ryo-Ohki!

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.730
Plus everyone came because they were worried about you.

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:31.100
You're not alone anymore!

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:32.930
I'm here with you too!

00:19:48.380 --> 00:19:49.680
Fuku...

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:07.990
Just a little more! Keep it up, Fuku!

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:12.210
They've put some distance between them and the pirate ships!

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:16.080
Alright! Prepare to fire the Chobimaru's cannons!

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:18.750
How dare they make Fuku-chan cry...!

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:21.280
You have the honors, Amane!

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:23.010
R-roger!

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:25.090
What's with that ship?!

00:20:25.090 --> 00:20:27.460
I don't remember any ships being that huge...!

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:29.990
Captain! It's aiming this way!

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:34.360
A planetary obliteration weapon, against a fleet of ships...?!

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:36.960
This is insane! Emergency escape!

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:40.330
I'm picking up an even more powerful ship in front of us!

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:41.360
What?!

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:46.510
Ryo-Ohki...!

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:48.480
Is this for real...?!

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:56.420
We surrender! We give up! Don't...!

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:14.670
Forgive us, Fuku-chan.

00:21:14.670 --> 00:21:17.600
Well, the situation is over for the time being.

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:21.010
I'm sorry for worrying you...

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:22.010
That's all right.

00:21:22.010 --> 00:21:24.580
Anyway, since you're already there, go ahead and stop by your house.

00:21:24.580 --> 00:21:25.910
Eh? But...

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:28.580
You've been doing nothing but mission after mission, right?

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:30.850
Consider it special leave.

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:31.720
Alright!

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:33.120
Yay!

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:36.390
Go and show your family your energetic face!

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:37.650
Right...

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:43.430
Um... okay, I'll do that then!

00:21:43.430 --> 00:21:45.190
Yahoo!

00:21:51.610 --> 00:21:54.240
We said we surrendered, so why...?!

00:21:54.240 --> 00:21:56.440
Boss, they're still chasing us...!

00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:58.140
Why?!

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:06.580
We're sorry!

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:27.020
You're the worst, most hopeless,
most unlucky boy in all of space...

00:22:32.260 --> 00:22:34.890
Even against your will...
(You fail.)

00:22:34.890 --> 00:22:36.700
Even when you're gentle...
(You're extremely clumsy.)

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:41.200
With too much fighting spirit,
in vain, it's all coming to nothing...

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:44.190
You're gonna fail.

00:22:45.370 --> 00:22:48.040
Carefully...
(So irritating!)

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:50.040
Or with violence...
(Ow! Quit it!)

00:22:50.040 --> 00:23:01.110
You're the worst and most hopeless...
you're a lost cause.

00:23:05.560 --> 00:23:10.830
You're the worst and the most hopeless...


00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:15.170
You're an unlucky boy...

00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:20.510
But, any way, I'm with you.

00:23:20.510 --> 00:23:25.670
So, more and more,
keep on doing what you do!

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:35.470
Taking the principal's suggestion, we've decided to return to Earth.

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:38.380
But Amane-san and Ryoko-san seem a little too excited,

00:23:38.380 --> 00:23:40.410
plus we pick up a strange little boy on the way there,

00:23:40.410 --> 00:23:42.550
so it doesn't look like you can call it a very relaxing break.

00:23:42.550 --> 00:23:44.420
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP!

00:23:44.420 --> 00:23:45.780
Homecoming
